<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"So, what's it gonna be?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Really... all right. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But, please, as quick as we can. The cherry blossoms are out, after all..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Okay! <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>'s health comes first!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> let out a happy cry and shot to her feet.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "僕らの日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">Well, I'm in good shape today, so I should at least keep her company that far.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">We quickly cleared off the table and left the apartment.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\外廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"All riiight! Let's have a go at digging up the truth of the matter behind this murder!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エレベーター前.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エレベーター中.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\マンション入り口.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\駐輪場.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Outside, it was heavily overcast.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">There wasn't a single break in the clouds, and not a scrap of blue sky showed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But there was no wind, and it didn't look as if it was about to rain.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Now then, let's go!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Today </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> was oddly fired up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I know she's always on the go, but with me she's pretty indulgent.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Usually, if I show even a little resistance, she backs down right away...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">And yet she wanted to go, so, well, it couldn't be helped...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Besides, I wasn't feeling that bad today, and I'd had second thoughts about shutting myself up at home.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">There was a stay-at-home order out, but, well, never mind, never mind!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車開始.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車開始.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">We each climbed onto our own bikes, </STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車こぐ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "30"}
<STYLE ID="2">and headed for Central Park.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">From here to Central Park is about 10 minutes by bike.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\道1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜道.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">On the way, we went along the avenue of cherry trees.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Normally I avoid it on purpose, but without thinking I'd chosen this shortcut.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">My April sickness symptoms were lying low today, and I'd forgotten even my usual habit. [TN: A pun on gogatsu-byo, 'May sickness,' Japan's term for the May blues.]</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">―As we got closer to Central Park, things grew noisy.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
